      "id": "product-ultima",
      "firstLine": 1192,
      "sourceStartByte": 49791,
      "text": "<h3 class=\"cmp-title__text\">CITI ULTIMA</h3>\n</div>\n\n    \n</div>\n\n          \n     \n     \n     \n     \n\n</div>\n<div class=\"responsivegrid text-primary\">\n\n    \n    \n     \n     \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <div class=\"text max-w-none prose text-sm\">\n<div id=\"text-2c5a4f82a9\" class=\"cmp-text\">\n    <ul><li>AED 1,000 cashback subject to min spend criteria of AED 25,000 in 60 days.</li><li>50% off airline tickets (up to AED 2,000) once a year.</li><li>3<sup>rd</sup> night free at any hotel worldwide (unlimited).</li><li>Free Home check-in (4 per year).</li><li>Redeem Citi Miles for flights with any airline, class or destination.</li><li>Transfer miles to 11 partner airlines/hotels, including Turkish, Qatar &amp; British Airways.</li></ul>\r\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n</div>\n\n          \n     \n     \n     \n     \n\n</div>\n<div class=\"responsivegrid flex flex-col items-center mx-auto space-y-2\">\n\n    \n    \n     \n     \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <div class=\"title font-bold text-center text-primary\"><div id=\"title-30bc842b26\" class=\"cmp-title\">\n    <h2 class=\"cmp-title__text\">AED 1,000 Joining bonus Statement Credit</h2>\n</div>\n\n    \n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n<div id=\"text-742c92934f\" class=\"cmp-text\">\n    <table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"\ttext-align: center;\n\tborder: 1.0px solid black;\n\tpadding: 10.0px;\n\twidth: 120.0px;\n\"><p><small>Annual fee</small></p>\n<p><b>AED 3,000</b></p>\n</td><td style=\"\ttext-align: center;\n\tborder: 1.0px solid black;\n\tpadding: 10.0px;\n\twidth: 200.0px;\n\"><small>Minimum Monthly Income</small><br />\n<b>AED 36,750</b></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n</div>\n<div class=\"responsivegrid py-5 text-center\">\n\n    \n    \n     \n     \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <div class=\"button cmp-button--primary bg-orange-60