      "id": "product-prestige",
      "firstLine": 1369,
      "sourceStartByte": 55868,
      "text": "<h3 class=\"cmp-title__text\">CITI PRESTIGE</h3>\n</div>\n\n    \n</div>\n\n          \n     \n     \n     \n     \n\n</div>\n<div class=\"responsivegrid text-primary\">\n\n    \n    \n     \n     \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <div class=\"text max-w-none prose text-sm\">\n<div id=\"text-88df64a008\" class=\"cmp-text\">\n    <ul><li>AED 500 cashback subject to min spend criteria of AED 15,000 in 60 days.</li><li>Redeem points for cash rebates, travel related spend or points transfer to 11 partner airlines/hotels.</li><li>4<sup>th</sup> night free at any hotel locally for staycations, or anywhere worldwide.</li><li>Unlimited complimentary golf.</li><li>Buy 1 – get 1 free movie tickets &amp; Valet Parking each month.</li><li>Access to 1,200 lounges worldwide (&#43;guest) with MasterCard Travel Pass app.</li></ul>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n</div>\n\n          \n     \n     \n     \n     \n\n</div>\n<div class=\"responsivegrid flex flex-col items-center mx-auto space-y-2\">\n\n    \n    \n     \n     \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <div class=\"title font-bold text-center text-primary\"><div id=\"title-0784ab4482\" class=\"cmp-title\">\n    <h2 class=\"cmp-title__text\">AED 500 Joining bonus Statement Credit</h2>\n</div>\n\n    \n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n<div id=\"text-31e8afa30f\" class=\"cmp-text\">\n    <table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"\ttext-align: center;\n\tborder: 1.0px solid black;\n\tpadding: 10.0px;\n\twidth: 120.0px;\n\"><small>Annual fee</small><br />\n<b>AED 1,500</b></td><td style=\"\ttext-align: center;\n\tborder: 1.0px solid black;\n\tpadding: 10.0px;\n\twidth: 200.0px;\n\"><small>Minimum Monthly Income</small><br />\n<b>AED 30,000</b></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n</div>\n<div class=\"responsivegrid py-5 text-center\">\n\n    \n    \n     \n     \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <div class=\"bu