      "text": "<h3 class=\"cmp-title__text\">CITI PREMIER</h3>\n</div>\n\n    \n</div>\n\n          \n     \n     \n     \n     \n\n</div>\n<div class=\"responsivegrid text-primary\">\n\n    \n    \n     \n     \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <div class=\"text max-w-none prose text-sm\">\n<div id=\"text-cc9c504f78\" class=\"cmp-text\">\n    <ul><li>Redeem points for cash rebates, travel related spend or points transfer to 11 partner airlines/hotels.</li><li>Complimentary golf.</li><li>Access to 1,200 lounges worldwide (&#43;guest) with MasterCard Travel Pass app.</li><li>Flat 30% off movie tickets at VOX Cinemas every month.</li></ul>\n<p> </p>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n</div>\n\n          \n     \n     \n     \n     \n\n</div>\n<div class=\"responsivegrid flex flex-col items-center mx-auto space-y-2\">\n\n    \n    \n     \n     \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <div class=\"title font-bold text-center text-primary\"><div id=\"title-f5b20038c7\" class=\"cmp-title\">\n    <h2 class=\"cmp-title__text\">AED 250 Joining bonus Statement Credit</h2>\n</div>\n\n    \n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n<div id=\"text-28bd91bfec\" class=\"cmp-text\">\n    <table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"\ttext-align: center;\n\tborder: 1.0px solid black;\n\tpadding: 10.0px;\n\twidth: 120.0px;\n\"><small>Annual fee</small><br />\r\n<b>AED 750</b></td><td style=\"\ttext-align: center;\n\tborder: 1.0px solid black;\n\tpadding: 10.0px;\n\twidth: 200.0px;\n\"><small>Minimum Monthly Income</small><br />\r\n<b>AED 15,000</b></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n</div>\n<div class=\"responsivegrid py-5 text-center\">\n\n    \n    \n     \n     \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <div class=\"button cmp-button--primary bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-900\"><a id=\"button-510acf7561\" class=\"cmp-button\" data-cmp-clickable data-ctatype=\"link\" data-ctaname=\"Apply Now\" data-